---
import ArrowIcon from './ArrowIcon.astro';
---

<section class="hub-routes shell" id="routes" aria-labelledby="routes-title">
  <div class="hub-routes__heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Choose a route</p>
    <h2 id="routes-title">Start where your question starts.</h2>
    <p>Take the short path, or follow the whole system at your own pace.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="hub-route-grid">
    <a class="hub-card hub-card--work" id="work" href="/work/">
      <span class="hub-card__number">01 / Work</span>
      <div>
        <h3>See systems, not a screenshot wall.</h3>
        <p>Three flagship case studies, ShelfIQ in development, and five earlier projects.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hub-card__systems" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>Missing Children SA</span>
        <span>Fraud Rule Engine</span>
        <span>Agent Risk Monitor</span>
      </div>
      <strong class="hub-card__action">
        Explore work <ArrowIcon />
      </strong>
    </a>

    <a class="hub-card hub-card--journey" id="experience" href="/journey/">
      <span class="hub-card__number">02 / Journey</span>
      <div>
        <h3>Trace the work behind the roles.</h3>
        <p>Move through the career as a connected route rather than a list of dates.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hub-card__timeline" aria-hidden="true">
        <i></i>
        <span>2020</span>
        <i></i>
        <span>2023</span>
        <i></i>
        <span>2025</span>
        <i></i>
        <span>Now</span>
      </div>
      <strong class="hub-card__action">
        Follow the journey <ArrowIcon />
      </strong>
    </a>

    <a class="hub-card hub-card--profile" id="about" href="/profile/">
      <span class="hub-card__number">03 / Profile</span>
      <div>
        <h3>See the range behind the depth.</h3>
        <p>Capabilities, education, selected credentials, languages, community work, and CV.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="hub-card__capabilities" aria-hidden="true">
        <li>Full-stack products</li>
        <li>Back-end systems</li>
        <li>Cloud delivery</li>
        <li>Data and performance</li>
      </ul>
      <strong class="hub-card__action">
        View profile <ArrowIcon />
      </strong>
    </a>

    <a class="hub-card hub-card--guide" id="guide" href="/guide/">
      <span class="hub-card__number">04 / Guide</span>
      <div>
        <h3>Ask a question. Inspect the source.</h3>
        <p>Search published facts instantly, or opt into a local model that only ranks the same curated answers.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hub-card__prompts" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>What should I view first?</span>
        <span>Where has Phadima worked?</span>
        <span>What back-end experience does he have?</span>
      </div>
      <strong class="hub-card__action">
        Open the verified guide <ArrowIcon />
      </strong>
    </a>

    <a class="hub-card hub-card--contact" id="contact" href="/profile/#contact">
      <span>Have a role, project, or difficult software problem?</span>
      <strong>
        Start a conversation <ArrowIcon />
      </strong>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
